  <p class=\"H2\">Title :  Previous experience</p>\n    <p>Description : You must have an outstanding record of academic achievement and previous research experience.</p>\n    <p>Link URL:  </p>\n    <p>Icon: /content/dam/icons/approved-icons/recruitment-cv-resume-star.svg </p>\n</div>\n</div>\n\n        \n    </div>\n\n    \n</div>\n\n        \n    </div>\n\n    \n</div>\n<div class=\"cmp-wrapper-separator m-component-wrapper separator cmp-separator--large cmp-separator--white\">\n<div id=\"separator-869363bfec\" class=\"cmp-separator\">\n    <hr class=\"cmp-separator__horizontal-rule\" aria-hidden=\"true\" role=\"none\"/>\n</div></div>\n<div class=\"cmp-wrapper-js-teaser cmp-wrapper-teaser m-component-wrapper teaser-new m-js-editable-svelte-comp cmp-teaser--featured m-content-w-image--sandstone\">\n<div data-target-exf-injected-wrapper></div>\n<div data-img=\"/content/dam/people/students-in-situ/_33i3986.jpg\" data-cmp-data-layer=\"{&#34;rtp-options&#34;:{&#34;@type&#34;:&#34;corporate-commons/components/core/webupliftment-core/teaser&#34;,&#34;linkText&#34;:&#34;Scholarships and application timelines&#34;,&#34;linkType&#34;:&#34;Navigation&#34;,&#34;clickDetail&#34;:&#34;Tile,Button&#34;,&#34;linkUrl&#34;:&#34;&#34;,&#34;componentName&#34;:&#34;Teaser&#34;,&#34;parentId&#34;:&#34;container-e5fdc0daf4&#34;,&#34;parentName&#34;:&#34;Container&#34;,&#34;pageID&#34;:&#34;landing-page-8b1702a22b&#34;,&#34;componentId&#34;:&#34;rtp-options&#34;}}\" data-resource-path=\"/content/corporate/scholarships/australian-government-research-training-program/jcr:content/root/container_1764981414/teaser\">\n\n    <noscript>\n        <h3 data-toc-ignore>Scholarships and application timelines</h3>\n        <p></p>\n        <div>\n            Check the RTP scholarships available to you, and key dates for application and award.\n        </div>\n        <ul>\n            <li>\n                <a data-attr-to-prop-attr=\"href\" data-attr-to-prop-prop=\"link\" href=\"https://www.sydney.edu.au/scholarships/australian-government-research-training-program/rtp-domestic.html\">For domestic students</a>\n            </li>\n        \n            <li>\n                <a data-attr-to-prop-attr=\"href\" data-attr-to-prop-prop=\"link\" href=\"https://www.sydney.edu.au/scholarships/australian-government-research-training-program/rtp-international.html\">For international students</a>\n            </li>\n        </ul>\n        <p><a></a></p>\n    </noscript>\n</div>\n\n\n\n</div>\n<div class=\"experiencefragment\">\n\n    \n    \n\n\n\n\n    \n    \n    <div class=\"m-bespoke-layout cmp-wrapper-js-bespoke-container cmp-wrapper-bespoke-container m-component-wrapper m-js-editable-svelte-comp m-js-container m-bespoke-layout--padding-top-bottom m-bespoke-layout--bg-white m-bespoke-layout--fixed-width m-bespoke-layout--30-60-layout p-2-cols\">\n    \n    \n    <div id=\"bespoke-container-40644cf0c7\" class=\"m-bespoke-layout__inner \">\n        \n        <div class=\"m-webuplift-typography m-component-wrapper title cmp-title cmp-title--h2-serif\">\n<div data-cmp-data-layer=\"{&#34;title-3546b96aae&#34;:{&#34;@type&#34;:&#34;corporate-commons/components/core/webupliftment-core/title&#34;,&#34;repo:modifyDate&#34;:&#34;2025-09-16T05:10:59Z&#34;,&#34;dc:title&#34;:&#34;How to apply&#34;}}\" id=\"title-3546b96aae\" class=\"cmp-title\">\n    <h2 class=\"cmp-title__text\">How to apply</h2>\n</div>\n\n    \n\n</div>\n<div class=\"m-bespoke-layout cmp-wrapper-js-bespoke-container cmp-wrapper-bespoke-container m-component-wrapper m-js-editable-svelte-comp m-js-container\">\n    \n    \n    <div id=\"bespoke-container-7d28e89eec\" class=\"m-bespoke-layout__inner \">\n        \n        <div class=\"m-webuplift-typography m-rich-content m-component-wrapper text cmp-text cmp-wrapper-js-text m-js-editable-svelte-comp cmp-text--p-regular\"><div data-cmp-data-layer=\"{&#34;text-bc3bf8a8dd&#34;:{&#34;@type&#34;:&#34;corporate-commons/components/core/webupliftment-core/text&#34;,&#34;linkText&#34;:&#34;\\u003cp\\u003eTo be considered for a RTP scholarship and equivalent University scholarships, you must:\\u003c/p\\u003e\\n\\u003ch3\\u003eCommencing students\\u003c/h3\\u003e\\n\\u003col\\u003e\\n\\u003cli\\u003eApply for admission and submit all required documentation for admission to a higher degree by research through\\u0026nbsp;\\u003ca href\\u003d\\&#34;/content/corporate/study.html\\&#34;\\u003eSydney Courses\\u003c/a\\u003e\\u0026nbsp;by the deadlines outlined in the \\u0027Application and award timeline\\u0027 table \u2013 these differ for \\u003ca href\\u003d\\&#34;/content/corporate/scholarships/australian-government-research-training-program/rtp-domestic.html#timeline\\&#34;\\u003edomestic students\\u003c/a\\u003e and \\u003ca href\\u003d\\&#34;/content/corporate/scholarships/australian-government-research-training-program/rtp-international.html#timeline\\&#34;\\u003einternational students\\u003c/a\\u003e.\\u003c/li\\u003e\\n\\u003cli\\u003eSubmit the\\u0026nbsp;scholarship application form\\u0026nbsp;by the deadlines.\\u003c/li\\u003e\\n\\u003c/ol\\u003e\\n\\u003ch3\\u003eCurrently enrolled students\\u003c/h3\\u003e\\n\\u003col\\u003e\\n\\u003cli\\u003eBe currently enrolled in a higher degree by research.\\u0026nbsp;\\u003c/li\\u003e\\n\\u003cli\\u003eSubmit the\\u0026nbsp;scholarship application form\\u0026nbsp;by the deadlines.\\u003c/li\\u003e\\n\\u003c/ol\\u003e\\n&#34;,&#34;linkType&#34;:&#34;Navigation&#34;,&#34;clickDetail&#34;:&#34;Text&#34;,&#34;linkUrl&#34;:&#34;&#34;,&#34;componentName&#34;:&#34;Text&#34;,&#34;parentId&#34;:&#34;container-e5fdc0daf4&#34;,&#34;parentName&#34;:&#34;Container&#34;,&#34;pageID&#34;:&#34;landing-page-8b1702a22b&#34;,&#34;componentId&#34;:&#34;text-bc3bf8a8dd&#34;}}\" id=\"text-bc3bf8a8dd\" class=\"cmp-text\">\n    <p>To be considered for a RTP scholarship and equivalent University scholarships, you must:</p>\n<h3>Commencing students</h3>\n<ol><li>Apply for admission and submit all required documentation for admission to a higher degree by research through\u00a0<a href=\"/study.html\">Sydney Courses</a>\u00a0by the deadlines outlined in the &#39;Application and award timeline&#39; table \u2013 these differ for <a href=\"/scholarships/australian-government-research-training-program/rtp-domestic.html#timeline\">domestic students</a> and <a href=\"/scholarships/australian-government-research-training-program/rtp-international.html#timeline\">international students</a>.</li><li>Submit the\u00a0scholarship application form\u00a0by the deadlines.</li></ol>\n<h3>Currently enrolled students</h3>\n<ol><li>Be currently enrolled in a higher degree by research.\u00a0</li><li>Submit the\u00a0scholarship application form\u00a0by the deadlines.</li></ol>\n\n</div>\n\n    \n</div>\n<div class=\"cmp-wrapper-separator m-component-wrapper separator cmp-separator--small cmp-separator--white\">\n<div id=\"separator-0636feadc4\" class=\"cmp-separator\">\n    <hr class=\"cmp-separator__horizontal-rule\" aria-hidden=\"true\" role=\"none\"/>\n</div></div>\n<div class=\"cmp-wrapper-js-button cmp-wrapper-button m-component-wrapper m-js-editable-svelte-comp p-style-primary p-style-tertiary\">\n<div class=\"m-hidden\" data-resource-path=\"/content/experience-fragments/scholarships/rtp/how-to-apply/how-to-apply/jcr:content/root/bespoke_container_12/bespoke_container/button\" data-cmp-data-layer=\"{&#34;button-18ad5e5c4f&#34;:{&#34;@type&#34;:&#34;corporate-commons/components/core/webupliftment-core/button&#34;,&#34;componentName&#34;:&#34;Button&#34;,&#34;componentId&#34;:&#34;button-18ad5e5c4f&#34;,&#34;items&#34;:[{&#34;linkText&#34;:&#34;Submit RTP form&#34;,&#34;linkType&#34;:&#34;Navigation&#34;,&#34;clickDetail&#34;:&#34;Button&#34;,&#34;linkUrl&#34;:&#34;https://sydneyuniversity.formstack.com/forms/rtpapp&#34;,&#34;linkTarget&#34;:&#34;_blank&#34;,&#34;icon&#34;:&#34;&#34;,&#34;isAuthenticated&#34;:false,&#34;isPopup&#34;:false,&#34;accessibilityLabel&#34;:&#34;&#34;}],&#34;pare